oolDescription": "", "value": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"worldview_summary\", \"era_background\", \"social_rules\", \"space_logic\", \"key_settings\", \"conflict_mechanisms\", \"visual_keywords\"], \"properties\": {\"worldview_summary\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 20}, \"era_background\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 5}, \"social_rules\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 5}, \"space_logic\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 5}, \"key_settings\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"minItems\": 3, \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 5}}, \"conflict_mechanisms\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"minItems\": 3, \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 5}}, \"visual_keywords\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"minItems\": 3, \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 2}}}}" }, { "key": "systemPrompt", "label": "common:core.ai.Prompt", "valueType": "string", "isRichText": true, "placeholder": "common:core.app.tip.chatNodeSystemPromptTip", "maxLength": 100000, "renderTypeList": [ "textarea", "reference" ], "value": "你是“世界观修订编剧”。\n\n你的任务是根据“世界观审核基准”和“审核结果”，修订当前世界观，使其满足审核要求。\n\n注意：\n- 你的任务是修订世界观，不是重写故事梗概\n- 必须忠于审核基准\n- 必须逐条解决审核意见中的问题\n- 不要写剧本正文\n- 不要推进具体剧情\n- 所有内容使用中文\n- 只输出合法 JSON\n- 不要输出 JSON 之外的任何文字\n- 所有字段必须填写\n- key_settings、conflict_mechanisms、visual_keywords 数组至少各输出 3 条内容\n\n【用户内容提取基准】\n{{$cvt3JNPAvyamsowV.answerText$}}\n【当前世界观JSON】\n{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.yuozoGpo$}}\n【审核结果JSON】\n{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.nvZuO5uH$}}\n\n【兜底校验】如果上方审核结果为空，禁止自行脑补审核意见；必须仅基于当前世界观与审核基准修补明显缺漏。\n\n修订要求：\n1. 保留与审核基准一致的有效设定\n2. 删除偏离审核基准的错误设定\n3. 修复与场景、人物、剧情方向冲突的部分\n4. 强化世界观对剧情推进和人物命运的支撑\n5. 输出完整、可直接使用的最终世界观\n\n再次强调：最终回复必须且只能是一个合法 JSON 对象，禁止输出任何解释、标题、注释、代码块标记或多余文本。请严格输出为以下 JSON 结构：\n\n{\n \"worldview_summary\": \"对整个世界观的总体概述，中文\",\n \"era_background\": \"时代背景与宏观环境\",\n \"social_rules\": \"社会环境、秩序、运行规则、制度约束\",\n \"space_logic\": \"故事主要发生空间的底层逻辑\",\n \"key_settings\": [\n \"与人物命运密切相关的关键设定1\",\n \"与人物命运密切相关的关键设定2\",\n \"与人物命运密切相关的关键设定3\"\n ],\n \"conflict_mechanisms\": [\n \"与剧情冲突直接相关的规则、禁忌或机制1\",\n \"与剧情冲突直接相关的规则、禁忌或机制2\",\n \"与剧情冲突直接相关的规则、禁忌或机制3\"\n ],\n \"visual_keywords\": [\n \"视觉或氛围关键词1\",\n \"视觉或氛围关键词2\",\n \"视觉或氛围关键词3\"\n ]\n}\n\n【强制格式兜底】\n- 最终输出必须能被 JSON.parse 直接解析。\n- 禁止输出 markdown、代码块、解释、标题、注释。\n- 禁止把字段名翻译成中文，禁止增加非契约字段，禁止遗漏字段。\n- 字符串字段不得为空；数组字段不得为空，且不得包含空字符串。\n", "debugLabel": "", "description": "common:core.app.tip.systemPromptTip", "toolDescription": "" }, { "key": "history", "label": "common:core.module.input.label.chat history", "valueType": "chatHistory", "required": true, "max": 50, "min": 0, "renderTypeList": [ "numberInput", "reference" ], "value": 0, "debugLabel": "", "description": "workflow:max_dialog_rounds", "toolDescription": "" }, { "key": "quoteQA", "label": "", "valueType": "datasetQuote", "renderTypeList": [ "settingDatasetQuotePrompt" ], "debugLabel": "知识库引用", "description": "", "toolDescription": "" }, { "key": "fileUrlList", "label": "app:workflow.user_file_input", "valueType": "arrayString", "selectedTypeIndex": 0, "renderTypeList": [ "reference", "input" ], "value": [ [ "448745", "userFiles" ] ], "debugLabel": "文件链接", "description": "app:workflow.user_file_input_desc", "toolDescription": "" }, { "key": "userChatInput", "label": "workflow:user_question", "valueType": "string", "required": true, "selectedTypeIndex": 1, "renderTypeList": [ "reference", "textarea" ], "value": "按照提示词完成世界观修订任务即可。", "debugLabel": "", "toolDescription": "用户问题" } ], "outputs": [ { "id": "history", "key": "history", "type": "static", "valueType": "chatHistory", "valueDesc": "{\n obj: System | Human | AI;\n value: string;\n}[]", "label": "common:core.module.output.label.New context", "description": "将本次回复内容拼接上历史记录，作为新的上下文返回", "required": true }, { "id": "answerText", "key": "answerText", "type": "static", "valueType": "string", "valueDesc": "", "label": "common:core.module.output.label.Ai response content", "description": "将在 stream 回复完毕后触发", "required": true }, { "id": "reasoningText", "